# Who reviews what. Every path here resolves today, which is the point: a
# CODEOWNERS entry naming something that does not exist is silently ignored,
# so a file that looks reviewed by a team is reviewed by nobody.
#
# `@metanull` is a personal account and personal accounts have no teams. A
# website owned by an organisation should replace each line below with that
# organisation's teams (README, "Admin — creating a new website", step 8);
# until then one owner reviews all four areas, which is the truth.
